  "properties:10": {
    "betterquesting:10": {
      "autoClaim:1": 0,
      "desc:8": "One Router switches 8 calls. For a whole town, build an Exchange: a hall of Switching Racks, 3 wide and 5 tall, with up to 8 slices of 4 racks between its two caps and a ladder of frame boxes along its ridge. Build it all of one tier: LV, MV or HV Machine Casings, with Steel, Aluminium or Stainless Steel frames.%n%nIt draws power through an Energy Hatch for its tier and its racks, and joins a bus at each Line Hatch, on its caps, roof or floor. Each LV rack switches 8 calls at once, MV 16, HV 32; racks and hatches go up to the hall's tier.%n%nMore in the guide: [guide page=becom:wired.md]The wired network[/guide].",
